hind after finally starting the motor with the help of his mechanic.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":19},{"lap":1,"text":"Fagioli (Maserati) covered the first lap in 5m52s at 127.841 km/h average, followed by Dreyfus (Maserati) about 150 meters behind","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":17},{"lap":3,"text":"Then Williams in the Bugatti drove a new fastest lap of 5m38s at 133.136 km/h average speed that accelerated him past Dreyfus' Maserati.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":15},{"lap":3,"text":"Then Williams in the Bugatti drove a new fastest lap of 5m38s at 133.136 km/h average speed that accelerated him past Dreyfus' Maserati.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":15},{"lap":4,"text":"On the fourth lap Chiron stepped on the gas to overtake Fagioli, breaking the lap record with 5m37s at 133.531 km/h average speed.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":4,"text":"On the fourth lap Chiron stepped on the gas to overtake Fagioli, breaking the lap record with 5m37s at 133.531 km/h average speed.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":8,"text":"The battle between Chiron and Fagioli was first-class. After 100 km, eight laps, Fagioli was on Chiron's heels","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":17},{"lap":8,"text":"The battle between Chiron and Fagioli was first-class. After 100 km, eight laps, Fagioli was on Chiron's heels","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":17},{"lap":10,"text":"The Italian recaptured first place by pulverizing the lap record on the tenth round at 5m29s, 136.778 km/h,","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":17},{"lap":10,"text":"The Italian recaptured first place by pulverizing the lap record on the tenth round at 5m29s, 136.778 km/h,","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":17},{"lap":13,"text":"Ivanowski pits with a rear axle problem; the Mercedes-Benz is retired.","q":false,"c":21},{"lap":13,"text":"Ivanowski pits with a rear axle problem; the Mercedes-Benz is retired.","q":false,"c":21},{"lap":14,"text":"Chiron regains first place from Fagioli.","q":fals